## Reviewer wording not applied as written

- «консультація українською не проводиться» (uk-b 48, and the same clause I first added on 003/005/013/015) matches the column forbidden pattern `консультація українською` even when the sentence is negative, so the file fails `uk-consult-lang`. The four languages are named, and the negation bigram is not used.
- Dropping the digit from «за останній 1 рік», «за кожен 1 рік», and «до 1 раза» would fail the number check. Korean has 최근 1년, 1년, 1회, and 1배. The digit stays inside the new phrase.
- «до 1 раза суми реальної шкоди» is the statute’s cap of one times actual damages (소비자보호법 1배), which is the same ceiling as “not above the actual loss.” The Russian genitive «раза» is gone; the sentence now says the cap is the actual loss and keeps «1».
- Space thousands and «1,57 млн» for the pinned bio figure are normal Ukrainian typography. The checker and the bio test do not accept them, so the previous forms stay.
